\pard\b\fs20 Famine\b0\par
\fs16\par
Once there lived a great and arrogant people. They plundered what they could and would not share their wealth with anyone. Not even with the gods. Suddenly a famine broke out. After a whole series of deaths from starvation and of protests, a band of Clonks has now been sent out to settle the small fertile land in the south of the country. But the angry gods will not leave you in peace.\par
\par
\b Goal:\b0\par
Produce bread.\par
\par
\b Starting age:\b0\par
Middle Ages\par
\par
\b But:\b0\par
The gods will do everything they can to make the mission as hard as possible for you.\par
